stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Connecting
    Connecting --> Binding: TCP connect ok
    Connecting --> Backoff: connect error
    Binding --> Bound: bind_transceiver_resp ESME_ROK
    Binding --> Backoff: bind error, client.close first
    Bound --> Bound: enquire_link every 20s, auto EnquireLinkResp
    Bound --> Bound: submit_sm or deliver_sm resets inactivity timer
    Bound --> Idle: no PDU for SMS_INACTIVITY_TIMEOUT_SECS, unbind + close
    Idle --> Connecting: outbound message arrives, stored as pending_message
    Bound --> Backoff: event stream ended, ConnectionLost
    Backoff --> Connecting: sleep min 5s times 2^attempts, capped 60s
    Bound --> Stopped: shutdown signal, unbind + close
    Idle --> Stopped: shutdown signal
    Stopped --> [*]
